Pilot

Pilot includes selected core execution components from nanoMuse and uses
DeepSeek Harness as a dependency. Pilot's initial desktop interface and
local project navigation are adapted; complete project execution and
cross-device behavior remain under development.
The pinned nanoMuse Cloud relay, authentication, device hub, synchronization,
console and tests are also included, with separate Pilot launch/deployment
adapters. Public server deployment and full real-device execution acceptance
remain pending; see docs/RELAY.md.

